&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Introduction to eBPF With Grafana Beyla (Grafana Office Hours #25)</title><link>https://nicolevanderhoeven.com/blog/20240105-goh25-introduction-to-ebpf-with-grafana-beyla/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jan 2024 18:03:52 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://nicolevanderhoeven.com/blog/20240105-goh25-introduction-to-ebpf-with-grafana-beyla/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Nikola Grčevski, Principal Software Engineer at Grafana Labs, gives us an introduction to eBPF with Grafana Beyla. We discuss what is eBPF, how you can use it to auto-instrument applications, and how to get started with Beyla. eBPF observability is all the rage because we all want automagical instrumentation&amp;ndash; but does it live up to that promise? Nikola&amp;rsquo;s here to tell us what eBPF can and can&amp;rsquo;t do, and where he&amp;rsquo;d like to take Beyla next.&lt;/p&gt;
